            <description sparkle:format="markdown"><![CDATA[Build 5 adds in-app updates. From now on Loopframe checks for new builds automatically (Settings → About → Automatically check for updates) and can install them with one click. This build also includes the privacy and integrity improvements from build 4 and fixes the bundled yt-dlp on signed builds.

Because earlier builds have no updater, install this one manually from the download page; after that, updates arrive in the app.
